n%2Forj360%2F001Un9Srly1ijburvc2nzj60u013z77c02.jpg"],"kind":"post","author":"雷军","published":"2026-11-23T01:09:25.000Z"},{"id":"5368322069629740","title":"澎程探索版 [good]","link":"https://weibo.com/1749127163/RsFmSEp8o","description":"澎程探索版 [good]","content":"<p>澎程探索版 <img data-n=\"weibo-emoji\" alt=\"[good]\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fface.t.sinajs.cn%2Ft4%2Fappstyle%2Fexpression%2Fext%2Fnormal%2F7e%2F201810_good_mobile.png\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align:middle\"></p>","images":[],"kind":"repost","author":"雷军","published":"2026-11-22T23:46:23.000Z","references":[{"relation":"repost","id":"5368125795338002","link":"https://weibo.com/6363461340/RsAgjmoEO","item":{"id":"5368125795338002","title":"最近，开着小米澎程探索版的日常。\n最近家事多，更新慢了些。\n忙里偷闲的松弛感，基本都是这台探索版给的。\n支桌能办公，放倒能歇着，关上门就是专属的小空间。\n代步之外，还能装下所有零碎的情绪，这大概就是它","link":"https://weibo.com/6363461340/RsAgjmoEO","description":"最近，开着小米澎程探索版的日常。\n最近家事多，更新慢了些。\n忙里偷闲的松弛感，基本都是这台探索版给的。\n支桌能办公，放倒能歇着，关上门就是专属的小空间。\n代步之外，还能装下所有零碎的情绪，这大概就是它最棒的地方。\n#小米澎程##小米澎程[超话]##小米汽车##小米汽车[超话]# @雷军  ​​​","content":"<p>最近，开着小米澎程探索版的日常。<br>最近家事多，更新慢了些。<br>忙里偷闲的松弛感，基本都是这台探索版给的。<br>支桌能办公，放倒能歇着，关上门就是专属的小空间。<br>代步之外，还能装下所有零碎的情绪，这大概就是它最棒的地方。<br>#小米澎程##小米澎程[超话]##小米汽车##小米汽车[超话]# @雷军  ​​​</p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx1.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F006WEqZegy1ijb5sx9x66j32dc35snpe.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx1.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F006WEqZegy1ijb5t0lsgxj328h2z97wi.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx4.sinaimg.cn%2Forj360%2F006WEqZegy1ijb5t3k623j32dc35shdu.jpg\"></p><p data-n=\"weibo-image-block\"><img data-n=\"weibo-image\" alt=\"微博图片\" src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/weibo?url=htt